===Etymology===
From {{etyl|grc|en}} {{term|πνευμονία||lung disease|tr=pneumonia|lang=grc|sc=polytonic}} from {{term|πνεύμων||lung|tr=pneumōn|lang=grc|sc=polytonic}}.

===Noun===
'''pneumonia'''

# An acute or chronic inflammation of the lungs caused by [[virus]]es, [[bacterium|bacteria]] or other [[microorganism]]s, or sometimes by physical or chemical [[irritant]]s.

